From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:58:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: SDX55 modem support (WIP)

Boot the OnePlus 8 Pro's external SDX55 modem over PCIe/MHI: a Sahara
image loader for the flashless modem, the pci_generic profile and device
tree description, GIC MBI MSIs for PCIe2, and the EFS sync over Sahara
memory debug. Several patches are still debug quality (marked DEBUG).

Userspace (remote file system server, EFS sync saver, GNSS) and the
firmware handling are in the modem/ directory of the patch repository.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
