diff --git a/device/testing/linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/0017-WIP-bus-mhi-host-pci_generic-Support-flashless-SDX55.patch b/device/testing/linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/0017-WIP-bus-mhi-host-pci_generic-Support-flashless-SDX55.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..28a600ebdc
--- /dev/null
+++ b/device/testing/linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/0017-WIP-bus-mhi-host-pci_generic-Support-flashless-SDX55.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,94 @@
+From 8730d17bc520bc5f8a00e25fc0f85f90005d4515 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:46:31 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 17/30] WIP: bus: mhi: host: pci_generic: Support flashless
+ SDX55 described in DT
+
+The flashless SDX55 of the OnePlus 8 Pro reports the subsystem ID of a
+Foxconn module that boots from flash. Use a profile that loads the SBL over
+BHI and exposes the Sahara channels when the devicetree marks the device
+qcom,flashless.
+
+Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
+---
+ drivers/bus/mhi/host/pci_generic.c | 50 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
+ 1 file changed, 50 insertions(+)
+
